    "Sun-3":  "The part of you that needs to claim space is anchored in the small daily courage of love — brief words, quick stands, the small visible moves of bond. Show up consistently in the small things; the larger visibility builds from there. The steady you is the one being seen.",
    "Sun-4":  "The part of you that needs to be seen is anchored in home and inner ground in love. The bond keeps asking you to be visible from the rooted self, not the performed one. People recognize the difference; let the home version of you walk in. The version that lasts is the rooted one.",
    "Sun-5":  "The part of you that needs to claim space is anchored in romance and creative play. The bond keeps pulling toward visibility through what you make in love, the romance of doing. Honor that. Visible love that comes from joy travels further than visible love from duty.",
    "Sun-6":  "The part of you that needs to be seen is anchored in the daily-tending — service, repair, the small consistent care. Visibility in love here looks like reliability across years. Trust the slow path. The world rewards sustained love eventually, even when it is not immediately seen.",
    "Sun-7":  "The part of you that needs to claim space is anchored in close bonds. Love asks for visibility shared, not solo. Stand in your own light without dimming someone else's; that is the bond working. You do not have to be alone on the stage.",
    "Sun-8":  "The part of you that needs to be seen is anchored in shared depths. Visibility in love here is hard-earned through long change, hidden work that eventually shows. Trust the slow climb. The bond you become through deep work is more honest than any quick one.",
    "Sun-9":  "The part of you that needs to claim space is anchored in meaning and what you believe about love. The bond keeps pulling toward visibility through conviction, the long-arc reasons. Speak the why; people remember love that has a why even when they forget the what.",
    "Sun-10": "The part of you that needs to be seen is anchored directly in the public face of the bond. There is no separation here between identity and visibility. Carry the relationship with quiet pride; you have earned the visibility, and you do not need to earn it again every morning.",
    "Sun-11": "The part of you that needs to claim space is anchored in the wider circle. Visibility here comes through being supported and supporting in love. Receive the celebration without flinching. The community is part of love; you did not arrive alone.",
