    "Mars-3":  "The part of you ready to fight is anchored in the small daily moves. Heat shows up in pointed messages, brief decisive calls, the courage to speak in passing. Be sharp without cruel; the decisive small communication today is the one you will be glad you sent next week.",
    "Mars-4":  "The part of you ready to fight is anchored in home and inner ground. The bond keeps connecting heat to what you protect at the foundation — your time, your energy, the home-feeling in love. Defend what matters most without burning what matters less.",
