    "Rahu-1":  "The part of you that hungers for more is anchored in your body and identity. The bond keeps pulling toward bigger versions of yourself in love — claiming a stage, becoming someone unfamiliar to the comfortable you. Move toward it carefully; new ground is rewarding when you do not sprint into it blind.",
