    "Rahu-3":  "The part of you that hungers is anchored in the small daily moves. Restlessness shows up in wanting new ways of staying close, new short-form rhythms of love. Try one without committing; curiosity is the right currency, whole-life upheaval rarely the right response.",
    "Rahu-4":  "The part of you that hungers is anchored in home and inner ground. The pull is toward unfamiliar grounds in love — foreign-feeling bonds, new homes, leaving the familiar setup. Sit with the hunger before deciding; strong wantings need a few cycles to settle.",
